<title>USA: Audiovox Corp says increases net equity.</title>
<headline>Audiovox Corp says increases net equity.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audiovox Corp said Tuesday it has increased net equity by about $35.8 million after completing its exchange of debt for shares in the company.</p>
<p>Audiovox said it exhanged about $41.2 million of its $65 million 6-1/4 percent convertible subordinated debentures due 2001 for about 6.8 million shares of its Class A common stock.</p>
<p>Audiovox markets cellular telephones and accessories, automotive aftermarket sound and security equipment and accessories.</p>
</text>
